Autumn mornings along the Rhine often trap mist in the valley while the hills stay clear.
Looking out from Langer Eugen just before eight with a low fog across the Rheinaue and the river
and the peaks of the [Siebengebirge](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siebengebirge)
rising out of the mist.

It's worth getting in early.

